The footer should provide contact information, so I'll include an address, phone number, and email. This makes it easy for customers to get in touch.

Styling is crucial for a good impression. I'll use a consistent color scheme with green for a fresh, welcoming feel. The body will have white space and a light font for readability. Buttons should stand out with contrasting colors.

I'll make sure the page is responsive by using relative units and media queries if necessary, though for simplicity, I'll focus on a mobile-friendly design with appropriate padding and margins.

Finally, I'll add some suggestions for further enhancements, like images or a shopping cart, to give the user ideas for expanding the page.

